ain is as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-67b42a645b7c4e2242c7111ffeb54a9e\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/67b42a645b7c4e2242c7111ffeb54a9e\"></div></div></div>",
